    {
      "title": "Module 2: Invitations and Plans",
      "subtopics": [
        {
          "title": "2.1 Making and Responding to Invitations",
          "lessons": [
            {
              "title": "Inviting Someone Out",
              "weight": 3,
              "content": [
                {
                  "order": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "{\"time\":1700009103000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"bB8cC9dD0e\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Learn how to <b>invite</b> someone to do something:\"}},{\"id\":\"eE1fF2gG3h\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>Would you like to</b> come to my party? — Хочешь прийти на мою вечеринку?\",\"<b>Do you want to</b> go for a coffee? — Хочешь выпить кофе?\",\"<b>How about</b> going to the cinema on Saturday? — Как насчёт кино в субботу?\",\"<b>Let's</b> have dinner together! — Давай поужинаем вместе!\",\"<b>Are you free</b> on Friday evening? — Ты свободен в пятницу вечером?\"]}},{\"id\":\"hH4iI5jJ6k\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Accepting:</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"kK7lL8mM9n\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>Sure! That sounds great!</b>\",\"<b>I'd love to!</b> — Я бы с удовольствием!\",\"<b>Great idea! What time?</b>\"]}},{\"id\":\"nN0oO1pP2q\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Declining politely:</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"qQ3rR4sS5t\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>Sorry, I can't. I'm busy.</b> — Извини, не могу. Я занят.\",\"<b>I'd love to, but I have plans.</b> — Я бы хотел, но у меня планы.\",\"<b>Maybe next time!</b> — Может, в следующий раз!\"]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
                },
                {
                  "order": 2,
                  "type": "audio",
                  "content": {
                    "text": "Would you like to go for a coffee? I'd love to! What time? How about three o'clock?",
                    "type": "tts",
                    "audio_url": ""
                  }
                },
                {
                  "order": 3,
                  "type": "categorization",
                  "categories": [
                    {
                      "id": "cat_invite",
                      "name": "Inviting",
                      "color": "#1976d2"
                    },
                    {
                      "id": "cat_accept",
