            {
              "title": "Making Plans and Arrangements",
              "weight": 4,
              "content": [
                {
                  "order": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "{\"time\":1700009104000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"tT6uU7vV8w\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"When you accept an invitation, you need to <b>make arrangements</b> — agree on where and when:\"}},{\"id\":\"wW9xX0yY1z\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>Where shall we meet?</b> — Где мы встретимся?\",\"<b>What time?</b> — В котором часу?\",\"<b>Let's meet at the café.</b> — Давай встретимся в кафе.\",\"<b>Is seven o'clock OK?</b> — Семь часов подходит?\",\"<b>That works for me!</b> — Мне подходит!\",\"<b>See you then!</b> — Тогда до встречи!\",\"<b>Don't forget!</b> — Не забудь!\"]}},{\"id\":\"zA2bB3cC4d\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<em>Useful prepositions: <b>at</b> + time (at 7pm), <b>on</b> + day (on Saturday), <b>in</b> + place (in the café)</em>\"}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
                },
                {
                  "order": 2,
                  "type": "audio",
                  "content": {
                    "text": "Where shall we meet? Let's meet at the park. Is six o'clock OK? That works for me! See you then!",
                    "type": "tts",
                    "audio_url": ""
                  }
                },
