    {
      "title": "Module 3: Expressing Opinions",
      "subtopics": [],
      "lessons": [
        {
          "title": "Agreeing and Disagreeing",
          "weight": 5,
          "content": [
            {
              "order": 1,
              "type": "text",
              "content": "{\"time\":1700009105000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"dD5eE6fF7g\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"In social conversations, we often share and respond to <b>opinions</b>. Here are useful phrases:\"}},{\"id\":\"gG8hH9iI0j\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Giving an opinion:</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"jJ1kK2lL3m\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>I think</b> the film is great. — Я думаю, фильм отличный.\",\"<b>In my opinion,</b> it is boring. — По-моему, это скучно.\",\"<b>I feel that</b> it was too long. — Мне кажется, это было слишком долго.\"]}},{\"id\":\"mM4nN5oO6p\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Agreeing:</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"pP7qQ8rR9s\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>I agree!</b> — Я согласен!\",\"<b>Exactly!</b> — Именно!\",\"<b>That's right.</b> — Верно.\",\"<b>Me too!</b> — Я тоже!\"]}},{\"id\":\"sS0tT1uU2v\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Disagreeing politely:</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"vV3wW4xX5y\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>I'm not sure about that.</b> — Я в этом не уверен.\",\"<b>I don't think so.</b> — Я так не думаю.\",\"<b>Actually, I disagree.</b> — На самом деле, я не согласен.\",\"<b>That's an interesting point, but...</b>\"]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
            },
            {
              "order": 2,
              "type": "audio",
              "content": {
                "text": "I think the film is great. I agree! In my opinion it was too long. I'm not sure about that.",
                "type": "tts",
                "audio_url": ""
              }
            },
