        {
          "title": "Talking About Likes and Preferences",
          "weight": 6,
          "content": [
            {
              "order": 1,
              "type": "text",
              "content": "{\"time\":1700009106000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"yY6zZ7aA8b\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"Use these phrases to talk about what you <b>like</b> and <b>prefer</b>:\"}},{\"id\":\"bB9cC0dD1e\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Preferences:</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"eE2fF3gG4h\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"I <b>prefer</b> coffee to tea. — Я предпочитаю кофе чаю.\",\"I <b>would rather</b> stay at home. — Я бы лучше остался дома.\",\"I <b>like</b> jazz, but I <b>love</b> classical music.\",\"I'm not keen on horror films. — Я не очень люблю фильмы ужасов.\"]}},{\"id\":\"hH5iI6jJ7k\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Asking about preferences:</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"kK8lL9mM0n\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>Which do you prefer</b> — coffee or tea? — Что ты предпочитаешь — кофе или чай?\",\"<b>What kind of music do you like?</b>\",\"<b>Do you enjoy</b> cooking? — Тебе нравится готовить?\"]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
            },
            {
              "order": 2,
              "type": "audio",
              "content": {
                "text": "I prefer coffee to tea. I'm not keen on horror films. Which do you prefer?",
                "type": "tts",
                "audio_url": ""
              }
            },
            {
              "order": 3,
              "type": "sentence-task",
              "tasks": [
                {
                  "sentence": "I prefer jazz ___ pop music.",
                  "answers": [
                    "to",
                    "than",
                    "or"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "sentence": "I ___ rather go to the café than cook at home.",
                  "answers": [
                    "would",
                    "will",
                    "could"
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "sentence": "She is not keen ___ action films.",
                  "answers": [
                    "on",
                    "in",
