        {
          "title": "4.1 Saying Sorry",
          "lessons": [
            {
              "title": "Apologies and Excuses",
              "weight": 7,
              "content": [
                {
                  "order": 1,
                  "type": "text",
                  "content": "{\"time\":1700009107000,\"blocks\":[{\"id\":\"nN1oO2pP3q\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"In social situations, we sometimes need to <b>apologise</b> (say sorry). Here is how:\"}},{\"id\":\"qQ4rR5sS6t\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Apologising:</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"tT7uU8vV9w\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>Sorry!</b> — Извини!\",\"<b>I'm sorry.</b> — Мне жаль.\",\"<b>I'm really sorry.</b> — Мне очень жаль.\",\"<b>I apologise.</b> — Приношу свои извинения.\",\"<b>I'm sorry I'm late.</b> — Извини, что опоздал.\"]}},{\"id\":\"wW0xX1yY2z\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Giving an excuse:</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"zA3bB4cC5d\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>I missed the bus.</b> — Я пропустил автобус.\",\"<b>The traffic was terrible.</b> — Были ужасные пробки.\",\"<b>I forgot.</b> — Я забыл.\",\"<b>Something came up.</b> — Кое-что случилось.\"]}},{\"id\":\"dD6eE7fF8g\",\"type\":\"paragraph\",\"data\":{\"text\":\"<b>Accepting an apology:</b>\"}},{\"id\":\"gG9hH0iI1j\",\"type\":\"list\",\"data\":{\"style\":\"unordered\",\"items\":[\"<b>That's OK!</b> — Всё в порядке!\",\"<b>No problem.</b> — Не проблема.\",\"<b>Don't worry about it.</b> — Не переживай.\"]}}],\"version\":\"2.31.4\"}"
                },
                {
                  "order": 2,
                  "type": "audio",
                  "content": {
                    "text": "I'm really sorry I'm late. The traffic was terrible. That's OK, don't worry about it!",
                    "type": "tts",
